    "title": "Festival marks 1500th birth anniversary of Prophet Muhammad (PBUH)",
    "text": "Gisoo Misha Ahmadi\nPress TV, Tehran\nAs the Muslim world marks the 1500th birth anniversary of Prophet Muhammad (PBUH), Iran is celebrating with a vibrant ten-day festival aimed at fostering unity among its diverse communities.\nThe “Iran Azizz” or “Dear Iran” event at Tehran’s iconic Lake is a ten‑night showcase of Iranian unity, music, and shared heritage.",
